            "inlines": [
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "See equivalent in the Reactive stack"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "web/webflux/dispatcher-handler.html"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "span",
            "roles": [
              "small"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Spring MVC, as many other web frameworks, is designed around the front controller pattern where a central "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Servlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "DispatcherServlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", provides a shared algorithm for request processing, while actual work is performed by configurable delegate components. This model is flexible and supports diverse workflows."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "DispatcherServlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", as any "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Servlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", needs to be declared and mapped according to the Servlet specification by using Java configuration or in "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "web.xml"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ". In turn, the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "DispatcherServlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " uses Spring configuration to discover the delegate components it needs for request mapping, view resolution, exception handling, "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "and more"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/special-bean-types.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The following example of the Java configuration registers and initializes the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "DispatcherServlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", which is auto-detected by the Servlet container (see "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Servlet Config"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/container-config.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "):"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "dlist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "public class MyWebApplicationInitializer implements WebApplicationInitializer {\n\n\t@Override\n\tpublic void onStartup(ServletContext servletContext) {\n\n\t\t// Load Spring web application configuration\n\t\tAnnotationConfigWebApplicationContext context = new AnnotationConfigWebApplicationContext();\n\t\tcontext.register(AppConfig.class);\n\n\t\t// Create and register the DispatcherServlet\n\t\tDispatcherServlet servlet = new DispatcherServlet(context);\n\t\tServletRegistration.Dynamic registration = servletContext.addServlet(\"app\", servlet);\n\t\tregistration.setLoadOnStartup(1);\n\t\tregistration.addMapping(\"/app/*\");\n\t}\n}"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "java",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Java"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "class MyWebApplicationInitializer : WebApplicationInitializer {\n\n\toverride fun onStartup(servletContext: ServletContext) {\n\n\t\t// Load Spring web application configuration\n\t\tval context = AnnotationConfigWebApplicationContext()\n\t\tcontext.register(AppConfig::class.java)\n\n\t\t// Create and register the DispatcherServlet\n\t\tval servlet = DispatcherServlet(context)\n\t\tval registration = servletContext.addServlet(\"app\", servlet)\n\t\tregistration.setLoadOnStartup(1)\n\t\tregistration.addMapping(\"/app/*\")\n\t}\n}"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "kotlin",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Kotlin"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "example",
        "id": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "admonition",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "In addition to using the ServletContext API directly, you can also extend "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "AbstractAnnotationConfigDispatcherServletInitializer"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " and override specific methods (see the example under "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Context Hierarchy"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/context-hierarchy.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ")."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null,
        "type": "note"
      },
      {
        "context": "admonition",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "For programmatic use cases, a "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "GenericWebApplicationContext"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " can be used as an alternative to "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "AnnotationConfigWebApplicationContext"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ". See the "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "GenericWebApplicationContext"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              }
            ],
            "kind": "link",
            "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/support/GenericWebApplicationContext.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " javadoc for details."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null,
        "type": "note"
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The following example of "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "web.xml"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " configuration registers and initializes the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "DispatcherServlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ":"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "listing",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "<web-app>\n\n\t<listener>\n\t\t<listener-class>org.springframework.web.context.ContextLoaderListener</listener-class>\n\t</listener>\n\n\t<context-param>\n\t\t<param-name>contextConfigLocation</param-name>\n\t\t<param-value>/WEB-INF/app-context.xml</param-value>\n\t</context-param>\n\n\t<servlet>\n\t\t<servlet-name>app</servlet-name>\n\t\t<servlet-class>org.springframework.web.servlet.DispatcherServlet</servlet-class>\n\t\t<init-param>\n\t\t\t<param-name>contextConfigLocation</param-name>\n\t\t\t<param-value></param-value>\n\t\t</init-param>\n\t\t<load-on-startup>1</load-on-startup>\n\t</servlet>\n\n\t<servlet-mapping>\n\t\t<servlet-name>app</servlet-name>\n\t\t<url-pattern>/app/*</url-pattern>\n\t</servlet-mapping>\n\n</web-app>"
          }
        ],
        "language": "xml",
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "admonition",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Spring Boot follows a different initialization sequence. Rather than hooking into the lifecycle of the Servlet container, Spring Boot uses Spring configuration to bootstrap itself and the embedded Servlet container. "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Filter"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " and "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Servlet"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " declarations are detected in Spring configuration and registered with the Servlet container. For more details, see the "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Spring Boot documentation"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "link",
            "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/reference/web/servlet.html#web.servlet.embedded-container"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null,
        "type": "note"
      }
    ],
    "outline": null,
    "title": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "DispatcherServlet"
